  <p id="c-nanshi-024-wangxu-yan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangxu-yan:p001:m0000" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">晏</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangxu-yan:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDACABBA">詡</persName>，位少府卿。敕未登<rs id="c-nanshi-024-wangxu-yan:p001:m0012" type="unresolved">黃門郎</rs>，不得畜女伎，<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangxu-yan:p001:m0022" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDACABBA">詡</persName>與射聲校尉<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangxu-yan:p001:m0028" ref="oh5_547_5te">陰玄智</persName>坐畜伎免官，禁錮十年。敕特原<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangxu-yan:p001:m0045" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDACABBA">詡</persName>。<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangxu-yan:p001:m0047" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDACABBA">詡</persName>亦篤舊。後拜廣州刺史。<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangxu-yan:p001:m0059" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">晏</persName>誅，上遣殺之。</p>
</text>
